      },
      {
        id: "r2",
        role: "assistant",
        text: "Found it. getRuns loads every run with all of its logs, about 18,000 rows, while the page renders 20. I added a limit and left the logs out. One follow-up worth doing: runs has no index on created_at, so the sort will slow down again as the table grows.",
      },
      { id: "r3", role: "user", text: "Add the created_at index then." },
      {
        id: "r4",
        role: "assistant",
